.SH NAME
omorfos\-recording \- Tells the omorfos desktop what records from a microphone or a camera, as PipeWire knows it
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\fBomorfos\-recording\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
The omorfos compositor starts it, and reads what it writes.
.SH OPTIONS
